text_en:
Whoever possesses within him three things will find the sweetness of faith,
and whoever does not possess them will not find it.
Those three things are: that his love for Allah and His Messenger (peace be upon him) should exceed his love for anything else;
that a man should love another man for no reason other than Allah’s pleasure;
and that it should be more pleasing to him to be cast into Hell than to return as a Jew or a Christian.
